ring 2010–2011.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Reporting rates are calculated by dividing the number of villages with endemic dracunculiasis that report each month by the total number of villages with endemic disease.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Each person is counted as a case only once during a calendar year.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}